Subject: [PATCH 07243/11362] [outer-loop] REQ-ARC-WMTE-5716: Phase 2
 game-agnostic exploration primitives in arc_solver_kit

Encodes the most mechanizable playbook patterns as reusable, live-path-safe
utilities (rendered frames + injected callables only, no env._game):
- probe_action_semantics: empirically measure each action's effect this level
  (playbook 1.1) instead of assuming carryover.
- read_absolute_trajectory: recover a sprite's absolute motion across the
  multi-layer animation array the camera-relative settled grid hides (2.3/2.4).
- find_unexplained_glyphs: surface uncatalogued objects to interrogate (2.1).
- bounded_reachability_search: pluggable semantic state-hash + honest
  proven(exhausted)-vs-search-capped status (3.1/3.2).
- bisect_death_prefix: isolate the minimal death-causing prefix (4.5).
27 unit tests, 100% line coverage of the new region, ruff+mypy clean.

